@startuml
left to right direction
skinparam dpi 200
skinparam backgroundColor transparent
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam defaultFontSize 16
skinparam roundcorner 10
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #4F46E5
  BorderThickness 1.3
  FontColor #1E1B4B
  BackgroundColor #EEF2FF
}
skinparam ArrowColor #4F46E5
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.3
skinparam ArrowFontColor #312E81
skinparam ArrowFontSize 13
skinparam nodesep 20
skinparam ranksep 40

rectangle "**Frontend**\nNext.js 15 (BFF)\ncookie httpOnly" as FE
rectangle "**Arhia.Api**\nControllers\ncomposition root" as API
rectangle "**Arhia.Core**\nPorts . Use Cases\nRBAC" as CORE
rectangle "**Arhia.Infrastructure**\nEF Core . Qdrant\nONNX . Ollama . SSE" as INFRA
rectangle "**Arhia.Domain**\nEntités pures" as DOM

FE -right-> API : HTTP, puis SSE
API -right-> CORE
API -down-> INFRA
CORE -down-> DOM
INFRA -right-> DOM
INFRA -up-> CORE
@enduml
